    <modExtensions>
      <li Class="GW40K_Necrons.NecronMechExtension">
        <coreSize>3</coreSize>
      </li>
    </modExtensions>
    <label>Cryptek</label>
    <description>Crypteks are the cryptographers and technomancers of the Necron courts — scholars of science so advanced it is indistinguishable from sorcery. Their frames are crystalline skeletons infused with arcane energy, supporting intellects that can bend reality at its roots. Asymmetric multi-lens optics and a logic-core devoted to technomancy feed a dense lattice of sensory data. Through Canoptek interfaces they bind lesser constructs, anchored by the same Command Protocol that shackles the legions to their masters.</description>
    <statBases>
      <ArmorRating_Blunt>0.40</ArmorRating_Blunt>
      <ArmorRating_Sharp>0.80</ArmorRating_Sharp>
      <PsychicSensitivity>1.25</PsychicSensitivity>
	  <MoveSpeed>1.6</MoveSpeed>
      <EnergyShieldRechargeRate>0.5</EnergyShieldRechargeRate>
      <EnergyShieldEnergyMax>3</EnergyShieldEnergyMax>
